description:
The sequel of the successful Unlock The King, now in a tridimensional board. An originally designed puzzle game inspired by chess. Move the pieces and create a path to Unlock the King. 

• Originally designed concept, including electronic board, lightning-fast piece movements, trigger buttons, and movable parts; 

• Designed for Unlock The King fans and newcomers alike;

• 70 original design levels; 

• Original soundtrack.
